      "content": "Here is a draft for your formal letter to your landlord in Berlin. You should send this via registered mail (*Einschreiben*) to ensure you have proof of delivery, which is important when dealing with maintenance issues.\n\n***\n\n[Your Name]\n[Your Apartment Number/Address]\n[Your Phone Number]\n[Your Email Address]\n\n[Landlord's Name/Company Name]\n[Landlord's Address]\n\n**Date:** [Current Date]\n\n**Subject: Urgent Repair Request – Non-functional Heating System in Apartment [Your Apartment Number]**\n\nDear [Landlord's Name or \"Sir/Madam\"],\n\nI am writing to formally report a significant and urgent maintenance issue within my rented apartment at [Your Address]. The radiator in the living room is completely broken, and consequently, the heating system is not functioning at all. As the weather is becoming increasingly cold, this lack of heating presents a serious habitability concern.\n\nI kindly request that you arrange for a qualified technician to inspect and repair the heating system as soon as possible. Please let me know when I can expect the repair work to commence. I am available to provide access to the apartment at your earliest convenience.\n\nThank you for",
