      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for this. can u add a bit more about the urgency? like, tell them that since the temperature is dropping, it's actually becoming a health issue and i might have to look into reducing my rent (Mietminderung) if they dont fix it quick. make it sound really firm but still polite.",
